{"articleNo":"83515","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=83515&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013 외국인유학생 채용상담회 안내(International Students Career Fair)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.05.23","hit":"3680","attachments":[{"name":"1.사전등록매뉴얼(Korean_English).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=83515&attachNo=71671"},{"name":"2.사전등록매뉴얼(Korean_Chinese).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=83515&attachNo=71824"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><!--StartFragment--><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;국립국제교육원에서는‘외국인 유학생 유치사업과 관련하여 학위과정을 마친 우수한 외국인 유학생들이 우리나라의 기업에 채용될 수 있도록 대한무역투자진흥공사(KOTRA)와 공동으로 ‘</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2013 KOTRA 글로벌 취업·인턴 채용상담회-2013 외국인유학생 채용상담회’</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">를 아래와 같이 개최하오니, 관심있는 외국인유학생들의 많이 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- &nbsp;아 &nbsp;&nbsp;래 &nbsp;-</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 행사 개요</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nb